      {
        "end": 763.48,
        "text": "and I want to say to you today, graduates class of 2009, that despite having",
        "start": 753.14
      },
      {
        "end": 771.46,
        "text": "achieved a remarkable milestone in your life, despite the fact that you and your",
        "start": 763.48
      },
      {
        "end": 781.0300000000001,
        "text": "families are so rightfully proud, you too cannot rest on your laurels, not even",
        "start": 771.46
      },
      {
        "end": 784.63,
        "text": "some of those remarkable young people who were introduced earlier, not even",
        "start": 781.03
      },
      {
        "end": 793.03,
        "text": "that young lady whose got 4 degrees she's getting today, you can't rest. Your own",
        "start": 784.63
      },
      {
        "end": 802.0899999999999,
        "text": "body of work is also yet to come. Now some graduating classes have marched",
        "start": 793.03
      },
      {
        "end": 809.95,
        "text": "into this stadium in easy times, times of peace and stability. When we call on our",
        "start": 802.09
      },
      {
        "end": 817.57,
        "text": "graduates simply to keep things going and don't screw it up. Other classes have",
        "start": 809.95
      },
      {
        "end": 822.97,
        "text": "received their diplomas in times of trial and upheaval, when the very",
        "start": 817.57
      },
      {
        "end": 828.6700000000001,
        "text": "foundations of our lives, the old order has been shaken, the old",
        "start": 822.97
      },
      {
        "end": 834.31,
        "text": "ideas and institutions have crumbled and a new generation is called upon to",
        "start": 828.67
      },
      {
        "end": 842.65,
        "text": "remake the world. It should be clear to you by now the category into which all",
        "start": 834.31
      },
      {
        "end": 851.8,
        "text": "of you fall. For we gather here tonight in times of extraordinary difficulty for",
        "start": 842.65
      },
      {
        "end": 859.0799999999999,
        "text": "the nation and for the world. The economy remains in the midst of a historic",
        "start": 851.8
      },
      {
        "end": 864.4300000000001,
        "text": "recession, the worst we've seen since the Great Depression, the result in part of",
        "start": 859.08
      },
      {
        "end": 869.89,
        "text": "greed and irresponsibility that rippled out from Wall Street and Washington,",
        "start": 864.43
      },
      {
        "end": 875.88,
        "text": "as we spent beyond our means and failed to make hard choices.",
        "start": 869.89
      },
      {
        "end": 888.0290000000001,
        "text": "We're engaged in two wars and a struggle against terrorism, the threats of climate",
        "start": 880.339
      },
      {
        "end": 894.33,
        "text": "change, nuclear proliferation and pandemic define national boundaries and",
        "start": 888.029
      },
      {
        "end": 902.76,
        "text": "easy solutions. For many of you, these challenges are also felt in more",
        "start": 894.33
      },
      {
        "end": 909.27,
        "text": "personal terms. Perhaps you're still looking for a job or struggling to",
        "start": 902.76
      },
      {
        "end": 916.62,
        "text": "figure out what career path makes sense in this disrupted economy. Maybe you've",
        "start": 909.27
      },
      {
        "end": 923.66,
        "text": "got student loans, now you definitely have student loans or credit card debts",
        "start": 916.62
      },
      {
        "end": 930.15,
        "text": "and you're wondering how you'll ever pay them off. Maybe you've got a family to",
        "start": 923.66
      },
      {
        "end": 937.1999999999999,
        "text": "raise and you're wondering how you'll ensure that your children have the same",
        "start": 930.15
      },
      {
        "end": 943.5,
        "text": "opportunities you've had to get an education and pursue their dreams. Now in",
        "start": 937.2
      },
      {
        "end": 950.25,
        "text": "the face of these challenges it may be tempting to fall back on the formulas",
        "start": 943.5
      },
      {
        "end": 958.2,
        "text": "for success that have been peddled so frequently in recent years. It goes",
        "start": 950.25
      },
      {
        "end": 963.12,
        "text": "something like this, you're taught to chase after all the usual brass rings,",
        "start": 958.2
      },
      {
        "end": 969.8100000000001,
        "text": "you try to be on this who's who's list or that top 100 list you chase after",
        "start": 963.12
      },
      {
        "end": 975.81,
        "text": "the big money and you figure out how big your corner office is. You worry about",
        "start": 969.81
      },
      {
        "end": 983.4899999999999,
        "text": "whether you have a fancy enough title or a fancy enough car. That's the message",
        "start": 975.81
      },
      {
        "end": 988.8,
        "text": "that's sent each and every day or has been in our culture for far too long.",
        "start": 983.49
      },
      {
        "end": 995.459,
        "text": "That through material possessions, through a ruthless competition pursued",
        "start": 988.8
      },
      {
        "end": 1001.51,
        "text": "only on your own behalf, that's how you will measure success.",
        "start": 995.459
      },
      {
        "end": 1010.1,
        "text": "Now you can take that road and it may work for some but at this critical",
        "start": 1001.58
      },
      {
        "end": 1016.49,
        "text": "juncture in our nation's history, at this difficult time, let me suggest that such",
        "start": 1010.1
      },
      {
        "end": 1024.05,
        "text": "an approach won't get you where you want to go. It displays a poverty of ambition",
        "start": 1016.49
      },
      {
        "end": 1031.819,
        "text": "that in fact the elevation of appearance over substance of celebrity over",
        "start": 1024.05
      },
      {
        "end": 1038.24,
        "text": "character of short-term gains over lasting achievement is precisely what",
        "start": 1031.819
      },
      {
        "end": 1042.14,
        "text": "your generation needs to help end.",
        "start": 1038.24
      },
      {
        "end": 1053.78,
        "text": "ASU I want to highlight -- I want to highlight two main problems with that",
        "start": 1049.28
      },
      {
        "end": 1060.6299999999999,
        "text": "old, tired, me first approach to life. First of all it distracts you from",
        "start": 1053.79
      },
      {
        "end": 1066.63,
        "text": "what's truly important and it may lead you to compromise your values and your",
        "start": 1060.63
      },
      {
        "end": 1073.98,
        "text": "principles and your commitments. Think about it, it's in chasing titles and",
        "start": 1066.63
      },
      {
        "end": 1078.6,
        "text": "status in worrying about the next election rather than the national",
        "start": 1073.98
      },
      {
        "end": 1083.75,
        "text": "interest and the interests of those who you're supposed to represent that",
        "start": 1078.6
      },
      {
        "end": 1090.15,
        "text": "politicians so often lose their ways in Washington. They spend time thinking",
        "start": 1083.75
      },
      {
        "end": 1096.5400000000002,
        "text": "about polls but not about principle. It was in pursuit of gaudy",
        "start": 1090.15
      },
      {
        "end": 1103.77,
        "text": "short-term profits and the bonuses that came with them that so many folks lost",
        "start": 1096.54
      },
      {
        "end": 1109.95,
        "text": "their way on Wall Street. Engaging in extraordinary risks with other people's",
        "start": 1103.77
      },
      {
        "end": 1117.02,
        "text": "money. In contrast, the leaders we revere,",
        "start": 1109.95
      },
      {
        "end": 1124.44,
        "text": "the businesses and institutions that last, they are not generally the result of a",
        "start": 1117.02
      },
      {
        "end": 1129.99,
        "text": "narrow pursuit of popularity or personal advancement but of devotion to some",
        "start": 1124.44
      },
      {
        "end": 1136.23,
        "text": "bigger purpose, the preservation of the Union or the determination to lift a",
        "start": 1129.99
      },
      {
        "end": 1143.07,
        "text": "country out of a depression, the creation of a quality product, a commitment to",
        "start": 1136.23
      },
      {
        "end": 1147.71,
        "text": "your customers, your workers, your shareholders and your community.",
        "start": 1143.07
      },
      {
        "end": 1153.0,
        "text": "A commitment to make sure that an institution like ASU is inclusive and",
        "start": 1147.71
      },
      {
        "end": 1162.08,
        "text": "diverse and giving opportunity to all. That's the hallmark of real success.",
        "start": 1153.0
      },
      {
        "end": 1174.7,
        "text": "That other stuff -- that other stuff, the trappings of success, may be a byproduct",
        "start": 1169.63
      },
      {
        "end": 1186.6000000000001,
        "text": "of this larger mission but it can't be the central thing. Just ask Bernie Madoff",
        "start": 1174.7
      },
      {
        "end": 1192.7,
        "text": "that's the first problem with the old attitude. The second problem with the old",
        "start": 1188.07
      },
      {
        "end": 1201.73,
        "text": "approach to success is that a relentless focus on the outward markers of success",
        "start": 1192.7
      },
      {
        "end": 1209.95,
        "text": "can lead to complacency. It can make you lazy. We too often let the external, the",
        "start": 1201.73
      },
      {
        "end": 1214.96,
        "text": "material thing serve as indicators that we're doing well even though something",
        "start": 1209.95
      },
      {
        "end": 1219.8500000000001,
        "text": "inside us tells us that we're not doing our best, that we're avoiding that which",
        "start": 1214.96
      },
      {
        "end": 1224.86,
        "text": "is hard but also necessary, that we're shrinking from rather than rising",
        "start": 1219.85
      },
      {
        "end": 1230.62,
        "text": "to the challenges of the age and the thing is in this new hyper competitive",
        "start": 1224.86
      },
      {
        "end": 1238.059,
        "text": "age none of us -- none of us can afford to be complacent. That's true. Whatever",
        "start": 1230.62
      },
      {
        "end": 1244.72,
        "text": "profession you choose. Professors might earn the distinction of tenure but that",
        "start": 1238.059
      },
      {
        "end": 1247.99,
        "text": "doesn't guarantee that they'll keep putting in the long hours and late",
        "start": 1244.72
      },
      {
        "end": 1255.3700000000001,
        "text": "nights and have the passion and the drive to be great educators. The same",
        "start": 1247.99
      },
      {
        "end": 1260.02,
        "text": "principle is true in your personal life. Being a parent is not just a matter of",
        "start": 1255.37
      },
      {
        "end": 1265.24,
        "text": "paying the bills, doing the bare minimum, it's not just bringing a child into the",
        "start": 1260.02
      },
      {
        "end": 1270.4,
        "text": "world that matters but the acts of love and sacrifice it takes to raise and",
        "start": 1265.24
      },
      {
        "end": 1273.8600000000001,
        "text": "educate that child and give them opportunity.",
        "start": 1270.4
      },
      {
        "end": 1287.98,
        "text": "It can happen to presidents as well, if you think about Abraham Lincoln and",
        "start": 1280.3
      },
      {
        "end": 1294.779,
        "text": "Millard Fillmore had the very same title. They're both presidents of the United",
        "start": 1287.989
      },
      {
        "end": 1301.159,
        "text": "States but their tenure in office and their legacy could not be more different",
        "start": 1294.779
      },
      {
        "end": 1306.3590000000002,
        "text": "and this is not just true for individuals, it's also true for this",
        "start": 1301.159
      },
      {
        "end": 1313.019,
        "text": "nation. In recent years, in many ways, we've become enamored with our own past",
        "start": 1306.359
      },
      {
        "end": 1322.109,
        "text": "success, lulled into complacency by the glitter of our own achievements. We've",
        "start": 1313.019
      },
      {
        "end": 1327.269,
        "text": "become accustomed to the title of military superpower, forgetting the",
        "start": 1322.109
      },
      {
        "end": 1333.719,
        "text": "qualities that got us there, not just the power of our weapons but the discipline",
        "start": 1327.269
      },
      {
        "end": 1338.959,
        "text": "and valor and the code of conduct of our men and women in uniform.",
        "start": 1333.719
      },
      {
        "end": 1350.009,
        "text": "The Marshall Plan and the Peace Corps and all those initiatives that show our",
        "start": 1344.629
      },
      {
        "end": 1354.75,
        "text": "commitment to working with other nations to pursue the ideals of opportunity and",
        "start": 1350.009
      },
      {
        "end": 1360.87,
        "text": "equality and freedom that have made us who we are. That's what made us a",
        "start": 1354.75
      },
      {
        "end": 1367.61,
        "text": "superpower. We become accustomed to our economic dominance in the world",
        "start": 1360.87
      },
      {
        "end": 1373.4089999999999,
        "text": "forgetting that it wasn't reckless deals and get-rich-quick schemes that got us",
        "start": 1367.61
      },
      {
        "end": 1378.6290000000001,
        "text": "where we are but hard work and smart ideas, quality products and wise",
        "start": 1373.409
      },
      {
        "end": 1384.4189999999999,
        "text": "investments. We started taking shortcuts, we started living on credit instead of",
        "start": 1378.629
      },
      {
        "end": 1388.669,
        "text": "building up savings, we saw businesses focused more on rebranding and",
        "start": 1384.419
      },
      {
        "end": 1394.1100000000001,
        "text": "repackaging than innovating and developing new ideas that improve our",
        "start": 1388.669
      },
      {
        "end": 1401.24,
        "text": "lives. All the while the rest of the world has grown hungry, more restless in",
        "start": 1394.11
      },
      {
        "end": 1407.159,
        "text": "constant motion to build and to discover, not content with where they are right",
        "start": 1401.24
      },
      {
        "end": 1414.509,
        "text": "now, determined to strive for more. They're coming so graduates it's now",
        "start": 1407.159
      },
      {
        "end": 1418.1,
        "text": "abundantly clear that we need to start doing things a little bit different.",
        "start": 1414.509
      },
      {
        "end": 1424.4699999999998,
        "text": "In your own lives you'll need to continuously adapt to a continuously",
        "start": 1418.1
      },
      {
        "end": 1430.259,
        "text": "changing economy. You'll end up having more than one job and more than one",
        "start": 1424.47
      },
      {
        "end": 1433.8600000000001,
        "text": "career over the course of your life. You'll have to keep on gaining new",
        "start": 1430.259
      },
      {
        "end": 1439.1689999999999,
        "text": "skills, possibly even new degrees and you'll have to keep on taking risks as",
        "start": 1433.86
      },
      {
        "end": 1446.3400000000001,
        "text": "new opportunities arise and as a nation we'll need a fundamental change of",
        "start": 1439.169
      },
      {
        "end": 1451.59,
        "text": "perspective and attitude. It's clear that we need to build a new foundation, a",
        "start": 1446.34
      },
      {
        "end": 1457.289,
        "text": "stronger foundation for our economy and our prosperity. Rethinking how we grow",
        "start": 1451.59
      },
      {
        "end": 1461.61,
        "text": "our economy, how we use energy, how we educate our children, how we care for our",
        "start": 1457.289
      },
      {
        "end": 1464.58,
        "text": "sick, how we treat our environment.",
        "start": 1461.61
      },
      {
        "end": 1480.86,
        "text": "Many of our current challenges are unprecedented. There are no standard",
        "start": 1475.58
      },
      {
        "end": 1487.799,
        "text": "remedies, no go to fixes this time around. And class of 2009, that's why we're going",
        "start": 1480.87
      },
      {
        "end": 1493.1689999999999,
        "text": "to need your help. We need young people like you to step up,",
        "start": 1487.799
      },
      {
        "end": 1498.749,
        "text": "we need your daring, we need your enthusiasm, we need your energy, we need",
        "start": 1493.169
      },
      {
        "end": 1503.6100000000001,
        "text": "your imagination and let me be clear when I say young I'm not just referring",
        "start": 1498.749
      },
      {
        "end": 1509.1589999999999,
        "text": "to the date of your birth certificate. I'm talking about an approach to life, a",
        "start": 1503.61
      },
      {
        "end": 1515.22,
        "text": "quality of mind and a quality of heart, a willingness to follow your passions",
        "start": 1509.159
      },
      {
        "end": 1521.309,
        "text": "regardless of whether they lead to fortune and fame, a willingness to",
        "start": 1515.22
      },
      {
        "end": 1528.6589999999999,
        "text": "question conventional wisdom and rethink old dogmas. A lack of regard for all the",
        "start": 1521.309
      },
      {
        "end": 1534.21,
        "text": "traditional markers of status and prestige and in a commitment instead to",
        "start": 1528.659
      },
      {
        "end": 1539.98,
        "text": "doing what's meaningful to you, what helps others, what makes a difference in this world.",
        "start": 1534.21
      },
      {
        "end": 1556.57,
        "text": "That's the spirit that led a band of patriots, not much older than most of you,",
        "start": 1549.6
      },
      {
        "end": 1563.31,
        "text": "to take on an empire, to start this experiment in democracy we call America.",
        "start": 1556.57
      },
      {
        "end": 1571.78,
        "text": "It's what drove young pioneers west to Arizona and beyond, it's what drove young",
        "start": 1563.81
      },
      {
        "end": 1577.69,
        "text": "women to reach for the ballot, what inspired a 30 year old escaped slave to",
        "start": 1571.78
      },
      {
        "end": 1585.51,
        "text": "run an underground railroad to freedom, what inspired a young man named cezzah",
        "start": 1577.69
      },
      {
        "end": 1592.54,
        "text": "to go out and help farmworkers, what inspired a 26 year old preacher to lead",
        "start": 1585.51
      },
      {
        "end": 1599.08,
        "text": "a bus boycott for justice, it's what led firefighters and police officers in the",
        "start": 1592.54
      },
      {
        "end": 1604.6299999999999,
        "text": "prime of their lives up the stairs of those burning towers and young people",
        "start": 1599.08
      },
      {
        "end": 1608.7700000000002,
        "text": "across this country to drop what they were doing and come to the aid of a",
        "start": 1604.63
      },
      {
        "end": 1618.81,
        "text": "flooded New Orleans to what led two guys in the garage named Hewlett and Packard",
        "start": 1608.77
      },
      {
        "end": 1624.97,
        "text": "to form a company that would change the way we live and work, what led scientists",
        "start": 1618.81
      },
      {
        "end": 1629.64,
        "text": "in laboratories and novelists in coffee shops to labor in obscurity until",
        "start": 1624.97
      },
      {
        "end": 1637.3300000000002,
        "text": "they finally succeeded in changing the way we see the world. That's the great",
        "start": 1629.64
      },
      {
        "end": 1644.11,
        "text": "American story. Young people just like you following their passions, determined",
        "start": 1637.33
      },
      {
        "end": 1650.58,
        "text": "to meet the times on their own terms. They weren't doing it for the money,",
        "start": 1644.11
      },
      {
        "end": 1660.76,
        "text": "their titles weren't fancy, ex-slave, minister, student, citizen, a whole bunch",
        "start": 1650.58
      },
      {
        "end": 1663.18,
        "text": "of them didn't get honorary degrees",
        "start": 1660.76
      },
      {
        "end": 1670.483,
        "text": "but they changed the course of history and so can you ASU.",
        "start": 1665.12
      },
      {
        "end": 1673.5,
        "text": "So can you class of 2009!",
        "start": 1670.483
      },
      {
        "end": 1686.4,
        "text": "So can you.",
        "start": 1684.94
      },
      {
        "end": 1695.739,
        "text": "With a degree from this outstanding institution you have",
        "start": 1690.16
      },
      {
        "end": 1700.6290000000001,
        "text": "everything you need to get started you've got no excuses, you have no",
        "start": 1695.739
      },
      {
        "end": 1710.4399999999998,
        "text": "excuses not to change the world. Did you study business? Go start a",
        "start": 1700.629
      },
      {
        "end": 1718.929,
        "text": "company or why not help a struggling not-for-profit find better more",
        "start": 1710.44
      },
      {
        "end": 1721.1000000000001,
        "text": "effective ways to serve folks in need.",
        "start": 1718.929
      },
      {
        "end": 1728.5400000000002,
        "text": "You study nursing?",
        "start": 1726.14
      },
      {
        "end": 1735.8400000000001,
        "text": "Under staffed clinics and hospitals across this country are desperate for your help.",
        "start": 1730.44
      },
      {
        "end": 1739.9,
        "text": "You study education?",
        "start": 1737.9
      },
      {
        "end": 1749.659,
        "text": "Teach in a high needs school where the kids really need you, give a chance to",
        "start": 1743.5
      },
      {
        "end": 1755.719,
        "text": "kids who can't get everything they need maybe in their neighborhood,",
        "start": 1749.659
      },
      {
        "end": 1761.3890000000001,
        "text": "maybe not even their home, but we can't afford to give up on them. Prepare them",
        "start": 1755.719
      },
      {
        "end": 1764.9799999999998,
        "text": "to compete for any job anywhere in the world.",
        "start": 1761.389
      },
      {
        "end": 1774.76,
        "text": "You study engineering?",
        "start": 1773.1
      },
      {
        "end": 1781.78,
        "text": "Help us lead a green revolution, developing new sources of clean energy.",
        "start": 1776.5
      },
      {
        "end": 1790.03,
        "text": "It will power our economy and preserve our planet but you can also make your",
        "start": 1781.78
      },
      {
        "end": 1794.1399999999999,
        "text": "mark in smaller more individual ways. That's what so many of you have already",
        "start": 1790.03
      },
      {
        "end": 1799.2,
        "text": "done during your time here at ASU tutoring children, registering voters,",
        "start": 1794.14
      },
      {
        "end": 1806.3400000000001,
        "text": "doing your own small part to fight hunger and homelessness, AIDS and cancer.",
