            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 305.767,
            "sentence_id": "s65",
            "start_seconds": 301.0
          },
          {
            "text": "to declare this speech sufficient Crown Forum",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 309.633,
            "sentence_id": "s66",
            "start_seconds": 305.767
          },
          {
            "text": "credits for any otherwise eligible student to graduate.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 314.26599999999996,
            "sentence_id": "s67",
            "start_seconds": 309.633
          },
          {
            "text": "That is my graduation gift to you.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 316.20000000000005,
            "sentence_id": "s68",
            "start_seconds": 314.266
          },
          {
            "text": "You have a special dispensation.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 328.90000000000003,
            "sentence_id": "s69",
            "start_seconds": 327.367
          },
          {
            "text": "Now, graduates, I am humbled to stand here with all of you as an",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 333.53299999999996,
            "sentence_id": "s70",
            "start_seconds": 330.967
          },
          {
            "text": "honorary Morehouse Man.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 335.5,
            "sentence_id": "s71",
            "start_seconds": 333.533
          },
          {
            "text": "I finally made it.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 341.433,
            "sentence_id": "s72",
            "start_seconds": 340.433
          },
          {
            "text": "And as I do, I'm mindful of an old saying: \"You can always tell",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 349.2,
            "sentence_id": "s73",
            "start_seconds": 344.9
          },
          {
            "text": "a Morehouse Man --",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 353.09999999999997,
            "sentence_id": "s74",
            "start_seconds": 349.2
          },
          {
            "text": "-- but you can't tell him much.\"",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 354.533,
            "sentence_id": "s75",
            "start_seconds": 353.1
          },
          {
            "text": "And that makes my task a little more difficult, I suppose.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 362.834,
            "sentence_id": "s76",
            "start_seconds": 359.3
          },
          {
            "text": "But I think it also reflects the sense of pride that's",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 366.033,
            "sentence_id": "s77",
            "start_seconds": 362.834
          },
          {
            "text": "always been part of this school's tradition.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 370.033,
            "sentence_id": "s78",
            "start_seconds": 366.033
          },
          {
            "text": "Benjamin Mays, who served as the president of Morehouse for",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 373.834,
            "sentence_id": "s79",
            "start_seconds": 370.033
          },
          {
            "text": "almost 30 years, understood that tradition better than anybody.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 379.5,
            "sentence_id": "s80",
            "start_seconds": 373.834
          },
          {
            "text": "He said -- and I quote -- \"It will not be sufficient for",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 383.5,
            "sentence_id": "s81",
            "start_seconds": 379.5
          },
          {
            "text": "Morehouse College, for any college, for that matter,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 387.5,
            "sentence_id": "s82",
            "start_seconds": 383.5
          },
          {
            "text": "to produce clever graduates...",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 391.133,
            "sentence_id": "s83",
            "start_seconds": 387.5
          },
          {
            "text": "but rather honest men, men who can be trusted in public and",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 396.667,
            "sentence_id": "s84",
            "start_seconds": 391.133
          },
          {
            "text": "private life -- men who are sensitive to the wrongs,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 401.9,
            "sentence_id": "s85",
            "start_seconds": 396.667
          },
          {
            "text": "the sufferings, and the injustices of society",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 405.5,
            "sentence_id": "s86",
            "start_seconds": 401.9
          },
          {
            "text": "and who are willing to accept responsibility for",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 408.533,
            "sentence_id": "s87",
            "start_seconds": 405.5
          },
          {
            "text": "correcting (those) ills.\"",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 409.834,
            "sentence_id": "s88",
            "start_seconds": 408.533
          },
          {
            "text": "It was that mission -- not just to educate men,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 416.266,
            "sentence_id": "s89",
            "start_seconds": 409.834
          },
          {
            "text": "but to cultivate good men, strong men,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 421.0,
            "sentence_id": "s90",
            "start_seconds": 416.266
          },
          {
            "text": "upright men -- that brought community leaders together",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 424.767,
            "sentence_id": "s91",
            "start_seconds": 421.0
          },
          {
            "text": "just two years after the end of the Civil War.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 428.467,
            "sentence_id": "s92",
            "start_seconds": 424.767
          },
          {
            "text": "They assembled a list of 37 men, free blacks and freed slaves,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 433.633,
            "sentence_id": "s93",
            "start_seconds": 428.467
          },
          {
            "text": "who would make up the first prospective class of what",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 436.667,
            "sentence_id": "s94",
            "start_seconds": 433.633
          },
          {
            "text": "later became Morehouse College.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 438.633,
            "sentence_id": "s95",
            "start_seconds": 436.667
          },
          {
            "text": "Most of those first students had a desire to become teachers and",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 443.3,
            "sentence_id": "s96",
            "start_seconds": 440.333
          },
          {
            "text": "preachers -- to better themselves so they could",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 447.166,
            "sentence_id": "s97",
            "start_seconds": 443.3
          },
          {
            "text": "help others do the same.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 448.233,
            "sentence_id": "s98",
            "start_seconds": 447.166
          },
          {
            "text": "A century and a half later, times have changed.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 454.166,
            "sentence_id": "s99",
            "start_seconds": 448.233
          },
          {
            "text": "But the \"Morehouse Mystique\" still endures.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 459.166,
            "sentence_id": "s100",
            "start_seconds": 454.166
          },
          {
            "text": "Some of you probably came here from communities where everybody",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 462.867,
            "sentence_id": "s101",
            "start_seconds": 459.166
          },
          {
            "text": "looked like you.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 465.06600000000003,
            "sentence_id": "s102",
            "start_seconds": 462.867
          },
          {
            "text": "Others may have come here in search of a community.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 467.7,
            "sentence_id": "s103",
            "start_seconds": 465.066
          },
          {
            "text": "And I suspect that some of you probably felt a little bit of",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 471.5,
            "sentence_id": "s104",
            "start_seconds": 467.7
          },
          {
            "text": "culture shock the first time you came together as a class",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 474.633,
            "sentence_id": "s105",
            "start_seconds": 471.5
          },
          {
            "text": "in King's Chapel.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 475.767,
            "sentence_id": "s106",
            "start_seconds": 474.633
          },
          {
            "text": "All of a sudden, you weren't the only high school sports captain,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 479.033,
            "sentence_id": "s107",
            "start_seconds": 475.767
          },
          {
            "text": "you weren't the only student council president.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 482.867,
            "sentence_id": "s108",
            "start_seconds": 479.033
          },
          {
            "text": "You were suddenly in a group of high achievers,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 486.767,
            "sentence_id": "s109",
            "start_seconds": 482.867
          },
          {
            "text": "and that meant you were expected to do something more.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 489.967,
            "sentence_id": "s110",
            "start_seconds": 486.767
          },
          {
            "text": "That's the unique sense of purpose that this place has",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 494.633,
            "sentence_id": "s111",
            "start_seconds": 492.233
          },
          {
            "text": "always infused -- the conviction that this is a training ground",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 499.7,
            "sentence_id": "s112",
            "start_seconds": 494.633
          },
          {
            "text": "not only for individual success, but for leadership that can",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 503.734,
            "sentence_id": "s113",
            "start_seconds": 499.7
          },
          {
            "text": "change the world.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 505.734,
            "sentence_id": "s114",
            "start_seconds": 503.734
          },
          {
            "text": "Dr. King was just 15 years old when",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 509.367,
            "sentence_id": "s115",
            "start_seconds": 507.266
          },
          {
            "text": "he enrolled here at Morehouse.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 512.4,
            "sentence_id": "s116",
            "start_seconds": 509.367
          },
          {
            "text": "He was an unknown, undersized, unassuming young freshman who",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 515.5,
            "sentence_id": "s117",
            "start_seconds": 512.4
          },
          {
            "text": "lived at home with his parents.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 517.133,
            "sentence_id": "s118",
            "start_seconds": 515.5
          },
          {
            "text": "And I think it's fair to say he wasn't the coolest kid on campus",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 522.633,
            "sentence_id": "s119",
            "start_seconds": 517.133
          },
          {
            "text": "-- for the suits he wore, his classmates called him \"Tweed.\"",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 526.2660000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s120",
            "start_seconds": 522.633
          },
          {
            "text": "But his education at Morehouse helped to forge the intellect,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 532.867,
            "sentence_id": "s121",
            "start_seconds": 528.8
          },
          {
            "text": "the discipline, the compassion, the soul force that would",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 536.4,
            "sentence_id": "s122",
            "start_seconds": 532.867
          },
          {
            "text": "transform America.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 538.4,
            "sentence_id": "s123",
            "start_seconds": 536.4
          },
          {
            "text": "It was here that he was introduced to the writings",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 542.5,
            "sentence_id": "s124",
            "start_seconds": 539.867
          },
          {
            "text": "of Gandhi and Thoreau, and the theory of civil disobedience.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 548.834,
            "sentence_id": "s125",
            "start_seconds": 542.5
          },
          {
            "text": "It was here that professors encouraged him to look past",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 551.5,
            "sentence_id": "s126",
            "start_seconds": 548.834
          },
          {
            "text": "the world as it was and fight for the world as it should be.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 554.667,
            "sentence_id": "s127",
            "start_seconds": 551.5
          },
          {
            "text": "And it was here, at Morehouse, as Dr. King later wrote,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 559.433,
            "sentence_id": "s128",
            "start_seconds": 554.667
          },
          {
            "text": "where \"I realized that nobody...was afraid.\"",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 564.567,
            "sentence_id": "s129",
            "start_seconds": 559.433
          },
          {
            "text": "Not even of some bad weather.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 568.066,
            "sentence_id": "s130",
            "start_seconds": 564.567
          },
          {
            "text": "I added on that part.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 569.3670000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s131",
            "start_seconds": 568.066
          },
          {
            "text": "I know it's wet out there.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 578.0999999999999,
            "sentence_id": "s132",
            "start_seconds": 571.233
          },
          {
            "text": "But Dr. Wilson told me you all had a choice and decided to do",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 581.3000000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s133",
            "start_seconds": 578.1
          },
          {
            "text": "it out here anyway.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 582.367,
            "sentence_id": "s134",
            "start_seconds": 581.3
          },
          {
            "text": "That's a Morehouse Man talking.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 588.9340000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s135",
            "start_seconds": 585.2
          },
          {
            "text": "Now, think about it.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 590.1999999999999,
            "sentence_id": "s136",
            "start_seconds": 588.934
          },
          {
            "text": "For black men in the '40s and the '50s,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 592.3330000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s137",
            "start_seconds": 590.2
          },
          {
            "text": "the threat of violence, the constant humiliations,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 597.967,
            "sentence_id": "s138",
            "start_seconds": 592.333
          },
          {
            "text": "large and small, the uncertainty that you could support a family,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 601.8,
            "sentence_id": "s139",
            "start_seconds": 597.967
          },
          {
            "text": "the gnawing doubts born of the Jim Crow culture that told you",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 606.0659999999999,
            "sentence_id": "s140",
            "start_seconds": 601.8
          },
          {
            "text": "every day that somehow you were inferior,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 609.3330000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s141",
            "start_seconds": 606.066
          },
          {
            "text": "the temptation to shrink from the world, to accept your place,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 613.7339999999999,
            "sentence_id": "s142",
            "start_seconds": 609.333
          },
          {
            "text": "to avoid risks, to be afraid -- that temptation",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 620.8340000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s143",
            "start_seconds": 613.734
          },
          {
            "text": "was necessarily strong.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 622.834,
            "sentence_id": "s144",
            "start_seconds": 620.834
          },
          {
            "text": "And yet, here, under the tutelage of men like Dr. Mays,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 628.6329999999999,
            "sentence_id": "s145",
            "start_seconds": 624.333
          },
          {
            "text": "young Martin learned to be unafraid.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 632.133,
            "sentence_id": "s146",
            "start_seconds": 628.633
          },
          {
            "text": "And he, in turn, taught others to be unafraid.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 636.2330000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s147",
            "start_seconds": 632.133
          },
          {
            "text": "And over time, he taught a nation to be unafraid.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 639.4,
            "sentence_id": "s148",
            "start_seconds": 636.233
          },
          {
            "text": "And over the last 50 years, thanks to the moral force of",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 644.633,
            "sentence_id": "s149",
            "start_seconds": 641.6
          },
          {
            "text": "Dr. King and a Moses generation that overcame their fear and",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 649.4000000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s150",
            "start_seconds": 644.633
          },
          {
            "text": "their cynicism and their despair,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 653.066,
            "sentence_id": "s151",
            "start_seconds": 649.4
          },
          {
            "text": "barriers have come tumbling down,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 654.6,
            "sentence_id": "s152",
            "start_seconds": 653.066
          },
          {
            "text": "and new doors of opportunity have swung open,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 659.2330000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s153",
            "start_seconds": 654.6
          },
          {
            "text": "and laws and hearts and minds have been changed to the point",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 664.1659999999999,
            "sentence_id": "s154",
            "start_seconds": 659.233
          },
          {
            "text": "where someone who looks just like you can somehow come to",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 668.1,
            "sentence_id": "s155",
            "start_seconds": 664.166
          },
          {
            "text": "serve as President of these United States of America.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 671.667,
            "sentence_id": "s156",
            "start_seconds": 668.1
          },
          {
            "text": "So the history we share should give you hope.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 683.433,
            "sentence_id": "s157",
            "start_seconds": 679.834
          },
          {
            "text": "The future we share should give you hope.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 689.8000000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s158",
            "start_seconds": 685.6
          },
          {
            "text": "You're graduating into an improving job market.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 692.6999999999999,
            "sentence_id": "s159",
            "start_seconds": 689.8
          },
          {
            "text": "You're living in a time when advances in technology and",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 696.3670000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s160",
            "start_seconds": 692.7
          },
          {
            "text": "communication put the world at your fingertips.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 699.6669999999999,
            "sentence_id": "s161",
            "start_seconds": 696.367
          },
          {
            "text": "Your generation is uniquely poised for success unlike",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 703.467,
            "sentence_id": "s162",
            "start_seconds": 699.667
          },
          {
            "text": "any generation of African Americans that came before it.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 708.533,
            "sentence_id": "s163",
            "start_seconds": 703.467
          },
          {
            "text": "But that doesn't mean we don't have work -- because if we're",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 712.2,
            "sentence_id": "s164",
            "start_seconds": 708.533
          },
          {
            "text": "honest with ourselves, we know that too few of our brothers",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 717.433,
            "sentence_id": "s165",
            "start_seconds": 712.2
          },
          {
            "text": "have the opportunities that you've had here at Morehouse.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 719.734,
            "sentence_id": "s166",
            "start_seconds": 717.433
          },
          {
            "text": "In troubled neighborhoods all across this country -- many of",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 726.1,
            "sentence_id": "s167",
            "start_seconds": 722.166
          },
          {
            "text": "them heavily African American -- too few of our citizens have",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 730.5,
            "sentence_id": "s168",
            "start_seconds": 726.1
          },
          {
            "text": "role models to guide them.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 732.633,
            "sentence_id": "s169",
            "start_seconds": 730.5
          },
          {
            "text": "Communities just a couple miles from my house in Chicago,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 736.066,
            "sentence_id": "s170",
            "start_seconds": 732.633
          },
          {
            "text": "communities just a couple miles from here -- they're places",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 740.1,
            "sentence_id": "s171",
            "start_seconds": 736.066
          },
          {
            "text": "where jobs are still too scarce and wages are still too low;",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 744.333,
            "sentence_id": "s172",
            "start_seconds": 740.1
          },
          {
            "text": "where schools are underfunded and violence is pervasive;",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 748.6669999999999,
            "sentence_id": "s173",
            "start_seconds": 744.333
          },
          {
            "text": "where too many of our men spend their youth not behind a desk in",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 752.033,
            "sentence_id": "s174",
            "start_seconds": 748.667
          },
          {
            "text": "a classroom, but hanging out on the streets or brooding behind a",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 756.734,
            "sentence_id": "s175",
            "start_seconds": 752.033
          },
          {
            "text": "jail cell.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 758.734,
            "sentence_id": "s176",
            "start_seconds": 756.734
          },
          {
            "text": "My job, as President, is to advocate for policies that",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 764.166,
            "sentence_id": "s177",
            "start_seconds": 760.5
          },
          {
            "text": "generate more opportunity for everybody -- policies that",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 767.3670000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s178",
            "start_seconds": 764.166
          },
          {
            "text": "strengthen the middle class and give more people the chance to",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 770.4,
            "sentence_id": "s179",
            "start_seconds": 767.367
          },
          {
            "text": "climb their way into the middle class.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 773.533,
            "sentence_id": "s180",
            "start_seconds": 770.4
          },
          {
            "text": "Policies that create more good jobs and reduce poverty,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 776.6,
            "sentence_id": "s181",
            "start_seconds": 773.533
          },
          {
            "text": "and educate more children, and give more families the security",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 779.6,
            "sentence_id": "s182",
            "start_seconds": 776.6
          },
          {
            "text": "of health care, and protect more of our children from the horrors",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 782.967,
            "sentence_id": "s183",
            "start_seconds": 779.6
          },
          {
            "text": "of gun violence.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 784.1999999999999,
            "sentence_id": "s184",
            "start_seconds": 782.967
          },
          {
            "text": "That's my job.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 785.7,
            "sentence_id": "s185",
            "start_seconds": 784.2
          },
          {
            "text": "Those are matters of public policy,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 787.8670000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s186",
            "start_seconds": 785.7
          },
          {
            "text": "and it is important for all of us -- black,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 790.367,
            "sentence_id": "s187",
            "start_seconds": 787.867
          },
          {
            "text": "white and brown -- to advocate for an America where everybody",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 793.934,
            "sentence_id": "s188",
            "start_seconds": 790.367
          },
          {
            "text": "has got a fair shot in life.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 795.3,
            "sentence_id": "s189",
            "start_seconds": 793.934
          },
          {
            "text": "Not just some.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 796.7669999999999,
            "sentence_id": "s190",
            "start_seconds": 795.3
          },
          {
            "text": "Not just a few.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 797.633,
            "sentence_id": "s191",
            "start_seconds": 796.767
          },
          {
            "text": "But along with collective responsibilities,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 803.6999999999999,
            "sentence_id": "s192",
            "start_seconds": 801.8
          },
          {
            "text": "we have individual responsibilities.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 805.734,
            "sentence_id": "s193",
            "start_seconds": 803.7
          },
          {
            "text": "There are some things, as black men,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 809.967,
            "sentence_id": "s194",
            "start_seconds": 807.8
          },
          {
            "text": "we can only do for ourselves.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 811.967,
            "sentence_id": "s195",
            "start_seconds": 809.967
          },
          {
            "text": "There are some things, as Morehouse Men,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 816.4,
            "sentence_id": "s196",
            "start_seconds": 814.033
          },
          {
            "text": "that you are obliged to do for those still left behind.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 819.567,
            "sentence_id": "s197",
            "start_seconds": 816.4
          },
          {
            "text": "As Morehouse Men, you now wield something even more powerful",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 825.4,
            "sentence_id": "s198",
            "start_seconds": 821.967
          },
          {
            "text": "than the diploma you're about to collect -- and that's the power",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 828.467,
            "sentence_id": "s199",
            "start_seconds": 825.4
          },
          {
            "text": "of your example.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 831.4,
            "sentence_id": "s200",
            "start_seconds": 828.467
          },
          {
            "text": "So what I ask of you today is the same thing I ask of every",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 834.367,
            "sentence_id": "s201",
            "start_seconds": 831.4
          },
          {
            "text": "graduating class I address: Use that power for something",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 839.0,
            "sentence_id": "s202",
            "start_seconds": 834.367
          },
          {
            "text": "larger than yourself.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 841.767,
            "sentence_id": "s203",
            "start_seconds": 839.0
          },
          {
            "text": "Live up to President Mays's challenge.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 844.533,
            "sentence_id": "s204",
            "start_seconds": 841.767
          },
          {
            "text": "Be \"sensitive to the wrongs, the sufferings,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 847.133,
            "sentence_id": "s205",
            "start_seconds": 844.533
          },
          {
            "text": "and the injustices of society.\"",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 848.667,
            "sentence_id": "s206",
            "start_seconds": 847.133
          },
          {
            "text": "And be \"willing to accept responsibility",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 851.567,
            "sentence_id": "s207",
            "start_seconds": 848.667
          },
          {
            "text": "for correcting (those) ills.\"",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 852.567,
            "sentence_id": "s208",
            "start_seconds": 851.567
          },
          {
            "text": "I know that some of you came to Morehouse from communities",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 857.633,
            "sentence_id": "s209",
            "start_seconds": 852.567
          },
          {
            "text": "where life was about keeping your head down and looking out",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 860.533,
            "sentence_id": "s210",
            "start_seconds": 857.633
          },
          {
            "text": "for yourself.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 863.066,
            "sentence_id": "s211",
            "start_seconds": 860.533
          },
          {
            "text": "Maybe you feel like you escaped, and now you can take your degree",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 866.3000000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s212",
            "start_seconds": 863.066
          },
          {
            "text": "and get that fancy job and the nice house and the nice car --",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 869.266,
            "sentence_id": "s213",
            "start_seconds": 866.3
          },
          {
            "text": "and never look back.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 871.567,
            "sentence_id": "s214",
            "start_seconds": 869.266
          },
          {
            "text": "And don't get me wrong -- with all those student loans you've",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 874.667,
            "sentence_id": "s215",
            "start_seconds": 871.567
          },
          {
            "text": "had to take out, I know you've got to earn some money.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 876.667,
            "sentence_id": "s216",
            "start_seconds": 874.667
          },
          {
            "text": "With doors open to you that your parents and grandparents could",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 881.8000000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s217",
            "start_seconds": 878.633
          },
          {
            "text": "not even imagine, no one expects you to take a vow of poverty.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 886.0659999999999,
            "sentence_id": "s218",
            "start_seconds": 881.8
          },
          {
            "text": "But I will say it betrays a poverty of ambition if all you",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 892.033,
            "sentence_id": "s219",
            "start_seconds": 886.066
          },
          {
            "text": "think about is what goods you can buy instead of what good",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 896.734,
            "sentence_id": "s220",
            "start_seconds": 894.2
          },
          {
            "text": "you can do.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 897.5,
            "sentence_id": "s221",
            "start_seconds": 896.734
          },
          {
            "text": "So, yes, go get that law degree.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 904.533,
            "sentence_id": "s222",
            "start_seconds": 902.6
          },
          {
            "text": "But if you do, ask yourself if the only option is to defend the",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 908.266,
            "sentence_id": "s223",
            "start_seconds": 904.533
          },
          {
            "text": "rich and the powerful, or if you can also find some",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 911.033,
            "sentence_id": "s224",
            "start_seconds": 908.266
          },
          {
            "text": "time to defend the powerless.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 913.0,
            "sentence_id": "s225",
            "start_seconds": 911.033
          },
          {
            "text": "Sure, go get your MBA, or start that business.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 919.133,
            "sentence_id": "s226",
            "start_seconds": 915.533
          },
          {
            "text": "We need black businesses out there.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 920.767,
            "sentence_id": "s227",
            "start_seconds": 919.133
          },
          {
            "text": "But ask yourselves what broader purpose your business might",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 924.0,
            "sentence_id": "s228",
            "start_seconds": 920.767
          },
          {
            "text": "serve, in putting people back to work,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 926.567,
            "sentence_id": "s229",
            "start_seconds": 924.0
          },
          {
            "text": "or transforming a neighborhood.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 928.467,
            "sentence_id": "s230",
            "start_seconds": 926.567
          },
          {
            "text": "The most successful CEOs I know didn't start out intent just on",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 932.066,
            "sentence_id": "s231",
            "start_seconds": 928.467
          },
          {
            "text": "making money -- rather, they had a vision of how their product or",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 935.1,
            "sentence_id": "s232",
            "start_seconds": 932.066
          },
          {
            "text": "service would change things, and the money followed.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 938.633,
            "sentence_id": "s233",
            "start_seconds": 935.1
          },
          {
            "text": "Some of you may be headed to medical school",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 943.8000000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s234",
            "start_seconds": 942.166
          },
          {
            "text": "to become doctors.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 945.967,
            "sentence_id": "s235",
            "start_seconds": 943.8
          },
          {
            "text": "But make sure you heal folks in underserved communities who",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 949.1999999999999,
            "sentence_id": "s236",
            "start_seconds": 945.967
          },
          {
            "text": "really need it, too.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 951.533,
            "sentence_id": "s237",
            "start_seconds": 949.2
          },
          {
            "text": "For generations, certain groups in this country -- especially",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 954.734,
            "sentence_id": "s238",
            "start_seconds": 951.533
          },
          {
            "text": "African Americans -- have been desperate in need of access to",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 958.633,
            "sentence_id": "s239",
            "start_seconds": 954.734
          },
          {
            "text": "quality, affordable health care.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 959.967,
            "sentence_id": "s240",
            "start_seconds": 958.633
          },
          {
            "text": "And as a society, we're finally beginning to change that.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 964.7669999999999,
            "sentence_id": "s241",
            "start_seconds": 959.967
          },
          {
            "text": "Those of you who are under the age of 26 already have",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 966.8340000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s242",
            "start_seconds": 964.767
          },
          {
            "text": "the option to stay on your parent's health care plan.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 969.266,
            "sentence_id": "s243",
            "start_seconds": 966.834
          },
          {
            "text": "But all of you are heading into an economy where many young",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 971.8,
            "sentence_id": "s244",
            "start_seconds": 969.266
          },
          {
            "text": "people expect not only to have multiple jobs,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 974.266,
            "sentence_id": "s245",
            "start_seconds": 971.8
          },
          {
            "text": "but multiple careers.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 976.333,
            "sentence_id": "s246",
            "start_seconds": 974.266
          },
          {
            "text": "So starting October 1st, because of the Affordable Care Act --",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 981.433,
            "sentence_id": "s247",
            "start_seconds": 976.333
          },
          {
            "text": "otherwise known as Obamacare --",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 983.567,
            "sentence_id": "s248",
            "start_seconds": 981.433
          },
          {
            "text": "-- you'll be able to shop for a quality,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 985.633,
            "sentence_id": "s249",
            "start_seconds": 983.967
          },
          {
            "text": "affordable plan that's yours and travels with you -- a plan that",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 989.3670000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s250",
            "start_seconds": 985.633
          },
          {
            "text": "will insure not only your health,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 991.1329999999999,
            "sentence_id": "s251",
            "start_seconds": 989.367
          },
          {
            "text": "but your dreams if you are sick or get in an accident.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 994.5,
            "sentence_id": "s252",
            "start_seconds": 991.133
          },
          {
            "text": "But we're going to need some doctors to make sure",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 996.967,
            "sentence_id": "s253",
            "start_seconds": 994.5
          },
          {
            "text": "it works, too.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 998.967,
            "sentence_id": "s254",
            "start_seconds": 996.967
          },
          {
            "text": "We've got to make sure everybody has good health in this country.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1002.8,
            "sentence_id": "s255",
            "start_seconds": 1000.3
          },
          {
            "text": "It's not just good for you, it's good for this country.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1004.834,
            "sentence_id": "s256",
            "start_seconds": 1002.8
          },
          {
            "text": "So you're going to have to spread the word to your fellow",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1007.266,
            "sentence_id": "s257",
            "start_seconds": 1004.834
          },
          {
            "text": "young people.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1009.9,
            "sentence_id": "s258",
            "start_seconds": 1007.266
          },
          {
            "text": "Which brings me to a second point: Just as Morehouse has",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1012.934,
            "sentence_id": "s259",
            "start_seconds": 1009.9
          },
          {
            "text": "taught you to expect more of yourselves,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1014.6669999999999,
            "sentence_id": "s260",
            "start_seconds": 1012.934
          },
          {
            "text": "inspire those who look up to you to expect more of themselves.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1018.467,
            "sentence_id": "s261",
            "start_seconds": 1014.667
          },
          {
            "text": "We know that too many young men in our community continue",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1023.1,
            "sentence_id": "s262",
            "start_seconds": 1020.6
          },
          {
            "text": "to make bad choices.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1025.2,
            "sentence_id": "s263",
            "start_seconds": 1023.1
          },
          {
            "text": "And I have to say, growing up, I made quite a few myself.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1028.4,
            "sentence_id": "s264",
            "start_seconds": 1025.2
          },
          {
            "text": "Sometimes I wrote off my own failings as just another example",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1034.6999999999998,
            "sentence_id": "s265",
            "start_seconds": 1030.667
          },
          {
            "text": "of the world trying to keep a black man down.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1037.967,
            "sentence_id": "s266",
            "start_seconds": 1034.7
          },
          {
            "text": "I had a tendency sometimes to make excuses for me not doing",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1043.2,
            "sentence_id": "s267",
            "start_seconds": 1037.967
          },
          {
            "text": "the right thing.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1044.2,
            "sentence_id": "s268",
            "start_seconds": 1043.2
          },
          {
            "text": "But one of the things that all of you have learned over the",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1048.066,
            "sentence_id": "s269",
            "start_seconds": 1044.2
          },
          {
            "text": "last four years is there's no longer any room for excuses.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1052.133,
            "sentence_id": "s270",
            "start_seconds": 1048.066
          },
          {
            "text": "I understand there's a common fraternity creed here at",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1060.333,
            "sentence_id": "s271",
            "start_seconds": 1057.633
          },
          {
            "text": "Morehouse: \"Excuses are tools of the incompetent used to build",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1065.633,
            "sentence_id": "s272",
            "start_seconds": 1060.333
          },
          {
            "text": "bridges to nowhere and monuments of nothingness.\"",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1070.7340000000002,
            "sentence_id": "s273",
            "start_seconds": 1065.633
          },
          {
            "text": "Well, we've got no time for excuses.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1073.9669999999999,
            "sentence_id": "s274",
            "start_seconds": 1070.734
          },
          {
            "text": "Not because the bitter legacy of slavery and segregation have",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1077.333,
            "sentence_id": "s275",
            "start_seconds": 1073.967
          },
          {
            "text": "vanished entirely; they have not.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1081.066,
            "sentence_id": "s276",
            "start_seconds": 1077.333
          },
          {
            "text": "Not because racism and discrimination no longer exist;",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1084.934,
            "sentence_id": "s277",
            "start_seconds": 1081.066
          },
          {
            "text": "we know those are still out there.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1086.8999999999999,
            "sentence_id": "s278",
            "start_seconds": 1084.934
          },
          {
            "text": "It's just that in today's hyperconnected,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1091.166,
            "sentence_id": "s279",
            "start_seconds": 1088.5
          },
          {
            "text": "hypercompetitive world, with millions of young people from",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1094.3,
            "sentence_id": "s280",
            "start_seconds": 1091.166
          },
          {
            "text": "China and India and Brazil -- many of whom started with a",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1098.2659999999998,
            "sentence_id": "s281",
            "start_seconds": 1094.3
          },
          {
            "text": "whole lot less than all of you did -- all of them entering the",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1102.633,
            "sentence_id": "s282",
            "start_seconds": 1098.266
          },
          {
            "text": "global workforce alongside you, nobody is going to give you",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1106.934,
            "sentence_id": "s283",
            "start_seconds": 1102.633
          },
          {
            "text": "anything that you have not earned.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1108.8,
            "sentence_id": "s284",
            "start_seconds": 1106.934
          },
          {
            "text": "Nobody cares how tough your upbringing was.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1114.367,
            "sentence_id": "s285",
            "start_seconds": 1110.767
          },
          {
            "text": "Nobody cares if you suffered some discrimination.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1117.533,
            "sentence_id": "s286",
            "start_seconds": 1114.367
          },
          {
            "text": "And moreover, you have to remember that whatever you've",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1124.133,
            "sentence_id": "s287",
            "start_seconds": 1120.934
          },
          {
            "text": "gone through, it pales in comparison to the hardships",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1127.7340000000002,
            "sentence_id": "s288",
            "start_seconds": 1124.133
          },
          {
            "text": "previous generations endured -- and they overcame them.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1131.033,
            "sentence_id": "s289",
            "start_seconds": 1127.734
          },
          {
            "text": "And if they overcame them, you can overcome them, too.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1133.7669999999998,
            "sentence_id": "s290",
            "start_seconds": 1131.033
          },
          {
            "text": "You now hail from a lineage and legacy of immeasurably strong",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1143.934,
            "sentence_id": "s291",
            "start_seconds": 1138.834
          },
          {
            "text": "men -- men who bore tremendous burdens and still laid the",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1147.734,
            "sentence_id": "s292",
            "start_seconds": 1143.934
          },
          {
            "text": "stones for the path on which we now walk.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1152.6999999999998,
            "sentence_id": "s293",
            "start_seconds": 1147.734
          },
          {
            "text": "You wear the mantle of Frederick Douglass and",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1154.3,
            "sentence_id": "s294",
            "start_seconds": 1152.7
          },
          {
            "text": "Booker T. Washington, and Ralph Bunche and Langston Hughes,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1157.633,
            "sentence_id": "s295",
            "start_seconds": 1154.3
          },
          {
            "text": "and George Washington Carver and Ralph Abernathy and Thurgood",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1161.3,
            "sentence_id": "s296",
            "start_seconds": 1157.633
          },
          {
            "text": "Marshall, and, yes, Dr. Martin Luther King,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1163.3999999999999,
            "sentence_id": "s297",
            "start_seconds": 1161.3
          },
          {
            "text": "Jr. These men were many things to many people.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1168.0330000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s298",
            "start_seconds": 1163.4
          },
          {
            "text": "And they knew full well the role that racism played",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1170.3,
            "sentence_id": "s299",
            "start_seconds": 1168.033
          },
          {
            "text": "in their lives.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1171.3,
            "sentence_id": "s300",
            "start_seconds": 1170.3
          },
          {
            "text": "But when it came to their own accomplishments and sense of",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1174.7,
            "sentence_id": "s301",
            "start_seconds": 1171.3
          },
          {
            "text": "purpose, they had no time for excuses.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1178.367,
            "sentence_id": "s302",
            "start_seconds": 1174.7
          },
          {
            "text": "Every one of you have a grandma or an uncle or a parent who's",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1182.233,
            "sentence_id": "s303",
            "start_seconds": 1178.367
          },
          {
            "text": "told you that at some point in life, as an African American,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1185.367,
            "sentence_id": "s304",
            "start_seconds": 1182.233
          },
          {
            "text": "you have to work twice as hard as anyone else if you",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1187.867,
            "sentence_id": "s305",
            "start_seconds": 1185.367
          },
          {
            "text": "want to get by.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1188.867,
            "sentence_id": "s306",
            "start_seconds": 1187.867
          },
          {
            "text": "I think President Mays put it even better: He said,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1193.2659999999998,
            "sentence_id": "s307",
            "start_seconds": 1188.867
          },
          {
            "text": "\"Whatever you do, strive to do it so well that no man living",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1198.1000000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s308",
            "start_seconds": 1193.266
          },
          {
            "text": "and no man dead, and no man yet to be born can",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1201.233,
            "sentence_id": "s309",
            "start_seconds": 1198.1
          },
          {
            "text": "do it any better.\"",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1202.6,
            "sentence_id": "s310",
            "start_seconds": 1201.233
          },
          {
            "text": "And I promise you, what was needed in Dr. Mays's time,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1211.7,
            "sentence_id": "s311",
            "start_seconds": 1208.433
          },
          {
            "text": "that spirit of excellence, and hard work, and dedication,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1215.433,
            "sentence_id": "s312",
            "start_seconds": 1211.7
          },
          {
            "text": "and no excuses is needed now more than ever.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1218.0,
            "sentence_id": "s313",
            "start_seconds": 1215.433
          },
          {
            "text": "If you think you can just get over in this economy",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1221.8,
            "sentence_id": "s314",
            "start_seconds": 1218.0
          },
          {
            "text": "just because you have a Morehouse degree,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1223.567,
            "sentence_id": "s315",
            "start_seconds": 1221.8
          },
          {
            "text": "you're in for a rude awakening.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1226.7,
            "sentence_id": "s316",
            "start_seconds": 1223.567
          },
          {
            "text": "But if you stay hungry, if you keep hustling,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1230.333,
            "sentence_id": "s317",
            "start_seconds": 1226.7
          },
          {
            "text": "if you keep on your grind and get other folks to do the same",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1234.133,
            "sentence_id": "s318",
            "start_seconds": 1230.333
          },
          {
            "text": "-- nobody can stop you.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1235.5330000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s319",
            "start_seconds": 1234.133
          },
          {
            "text": "And when I talk about pursuing excellence and setting an",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1242.9340000000002,
            "sentence_id": "s320",
            "start_seconds": 1240.4
          },
          {
            "text": "example, I'm not just talking about in your professional life.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1246.567,
            "sentence_id": "s321",
            "start_seconds": 1242.934
          },
          {
            "text": "One of today's graduates, Frederick Anderson --",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1251.567,
            "sentence_id": "s322",
            "start_seconds": 1248.7
          },
          {
            "text": "where's Frederick?",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1253.934,
            "sentence_id": "s323",
            "start_seconds": 1251.567
          },
          {
            "text": "Frederick, right here.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1254.934,
            "sentence_id": "s324",
            "start_seconds": 1253.934
          },
          {
            "text": "I know it's raining, but I'm going to tell about Frederick.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1261.567,
            "sentence_id": "s325",
            "start_seconds": 1257.0
          },
          {
            "text": "Frederick started his college career in Ohio,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1263.834,
            "sentence_id": "s326",
            "start_seconds": 1261.567
          },
          {
            "text": "only to find out that his high school sweetheart back",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1267.2,
            "sentence_id": "s327",
            "start_seconds": 1263.834
          },
          {
            "text": "in Georgia was pregnant.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1270.0330000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s328",
            "start_seconds": 1267.2
          },
          {
            "text": "So he came back and enrolled in Morehouse to be closer to her.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1274.2659999999998,
            "sentence_id": "s329",
            "start_seconds": 1270.033
          },
          {
            "text": "Pretty soon, helping raise a newborn and working night shifts",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1277.467,
            "sentence_id": "s330",
            "start_seconds": 1274.266
          },
          {
            "text": "became too much, so he started taking business classes at a",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1280.6670000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s331",
            "start_seconds": 1277.467
          },
          {
            "text": "technical college instead -- doing everything from delivering",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1284.867,
            "sentence_id": "s332",
            "start_seconds": 1280.667
          },
          {
            "text": "newspapers to buffing hospital floors to support his family.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1290.5,
            "sentence_id": "s333",
            "start_seconds": 1284.867
          },
          {
            "text": "And then he enrolled at Morehouse a second time.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1294.9,
            "sentence_id": "s334",
            "start_seconds": 1290.5
          },
          {
            "text": "But even with a job, he couldn't keep up with the",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1297.2,
            "sentence_id": "s335",
            "start_seconds": 1294.9
          },
          {
            "text": "cost of tuition.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1299.6670000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s336",
            "start_seconds": 1297.2
          },
          {
            "text": "So after getting his degree from that technical school,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1302.6999999999998,
            "sentence_id": "s337",
            "start_seconds": 1299.667
          },
          {
            "text": "this father of three decided to come back to Morehouse",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1305.6670000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s338",
            "start_seconds": 1302.7
          },
          {
            "text": "for a third time.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1306.8,
            "sentence_id": "s339",
            "start_seconds": 1305.667
          },
          {
            "text": "As Frederick says, \"God has a plan for my life,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1312.934,
            "sentence_id": "s340",
            "start_seconds": 1310.033
          },
          {
            "text": "and He's not done with me yet.\"",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1315.3329999999999,
            "sentence_id": "s341",
            "start_seconds": 1312.934
          },
          {
            "text": "And today, Frederick is a family man, and a working man,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1318.9,
            "sentence_id": "s342",
            "start_seconds": 1315.333
          },
          {
            "text": "and a Morehouse Man.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1320.2,
            "sentence_id": "s343",
            "start_seconds": 1318.9
          },
          {
            "text": "And that's what I'm asking all of you to do: Keep setting an",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1323.7,
            "sentence_id": "s344",
            "start_seconds": 1320.633
          },
          {
            "text": "example for what it means to be a man.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1325.7340000000002,
            "sentence_id": "s345",
            "start_seconds": 1323.7
          },
          {
            "text": "Be the best husband to your wife, or you're your boyfriend,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1343.4669999999999,
            "sentence_id": "s346",
            "start_seconds": 1337.667
          },
          {
            "text": "or your partner.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1351.767,
            "sentence_id": "s347",
            "start_seconds": 1343.467
          },
          {
            "text": "Be the best father you can be to your children.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1356.0,
            "sentence_id": "s348",
            "start_seconds": 1351.767
          },
          {
            "text": "Because nothing is more important.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1357.5,
            "sentence_id": "s349",
            "start_seconds": 1356.0
          },
          {
            "text": "I was raised by a heroic single mom,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1361.633,
            "sentence_id": "s350",
            "start_seconds": 1359.467
          },
          {
            "text": "wonderful grandparents -- made incredible sacrifices for me.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1364.7340000000002,
            "sentence_id": "s351",
            "start_seconds": 1361.633
          },
          {
            "text": "And I know there are moms and grandparents here today who did",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1367.667,
            "sentence_id": "s352",
            "start_seconds": 1364.734
          },
          {
            "text": "the same thing for all of you.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1370.5,
            "sentence_id": "s353",
            "start_seconds": 1367.667
          },
          {
            "text": "But I sure wish I had had a father who was not only present,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1373.8,
            "sentence_id": "s354",
            "start_seconds": 1370.5
          },
          {
            "text": "but involved.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1375.6,
            "sentence_id": "s355",
            "start_seconds": 1373.8
          },
          {
            "text": "Didn't know my dad.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1376.6,
            "sentence_id": "s356",
            "start_seconds": 1375.6
          },
          {
            "text": "And so my whole life, I've tried to be for Michelle and my girls",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1382.3329999999999,
            "sentence_id": "s357",
            "start_seconds": 1376.6
          },
          {
            "text": "what my father was not for my mother and me.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1385.5330000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s358",
            "start_seconds": 1382.333
          },
          {
            "text": "I want to break that cycle where a father is not at home --",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1389.867,
            "sentence_id": "s359",
            "start_seconds": 1385.533
          },
          {
            "text": "-- where a father is not helping to raise that son or daughter.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1396.667,
            "sentence_id": "s360",
            "start_seconds": 1391.033
          },
          {
            "text": "I want to be a better father, a better husband, a better man.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1402.667,
            "sentence_id": "s361",
            "start_seconds": 1396.667
          },
          {
            "text": "It's hard work that demands your constant attention and",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1405.8999999999999,
            "sentence_id": "s362",
            "start_seconds": 1402.667
          },
          {
            "text": "frequent sacrifice.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1408.5,
            "sentence_id": "s363",
            "start_seconds": 1405.9
          },
          {
            "text": "And I promise you, Michelle will tell you I'm not perfect.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1411.9,
            "sentence_id": "s364",
            "start_seconds": 1408.5
          },
          {
            "text": "She's got a long list of my imperfections.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1414.433,
            "sentence_id": "s365",
            "start_seconds": 1411.9
          },
          {
            "text": "Even now, I'm still practicing, I'm still learning,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1418.7669999999998,
            "sentence_id": "s366",
            "start_seconds": 1416.033
          },
          {
            "text": "still getting corrected in terms of how to be a fine husband and",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1422.2,
            "sentence_id": "s367",
            "start_seconds": 1418.767
          },
          {
            "text": "a good father.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1423.166,
            "sentence_id": "s368",
            "start_seconds": 1422.2
          },
          {
            "text": "But I will tell you this: Everything else is unfulfilled",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1429.767,
            "sentence_id": "s369",
            "start_seconds": 1425.7
          },
          {
            "text": "if we fail at family, if we fail at that responsibility.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1434.767,
            "sentence_id": "s370",
            "start_seconds": 1429.767
          },
          {
            "text": "I know that when I am on my deathbed someday,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1441.066,
            "sentence_id": "s371",
            "start_seconds": 1436.967
          },
          {
            "text": "I will not be thinking about any particular legislation I passed;",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1445.367,
            "sentence_id": "s372",
            "start_seconds": 1441.066
          },
          {
            "text": "I will not be thinking about a policy I promoted;",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1448.2,
            "sentence_id": "s373",
            "start_seconds": 1445.367
          },
          {
            "text": "I will not be thinking about the speech I gave,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1450.8,
            "sentence_id": "s374",
            "start_seconds": 1448.2
          },
          {
            "text": "I will not be thinking the Nobel Prize I received.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1453.533,
            "sentence_id": "s375",
            "start_seconds": 1450.8
          },
          {
            "text": "I will be thinking about that walk I took with my daughters.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1457.3329999999999,
            "sentence_id": "s376",
            "start_seconds": 1453.533
          },
          {
            "text": "I'll be thinking about a lazy afternoon with my wife.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1460.567,
            "sentence_id": "s377",
            "start_seconds": 1457.333
          },
          {
            "text": "I'll be thinking about sitting around the dinner table and",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1463.467,
            "sentence_id": "s378",
            "start_seconds": 1460.567
          },
          {
            "text": "seeing them happy and healthy and knowing that",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1466.5,
            "sentence_id": "s379",
            "start_seconds": 1463.467
          },
          {
            "text": "they were loved.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1467.5,
            "sentence_id": "s380",
            "start_seconds": 1466.5
          },
          {
            "text": "And I'll be thinking about whether I did right by",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1469.4,
            "sentence_id": "s381",
            "start_seconds": 1467.5
          },
          {
            "text": "all of them.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1471.6000000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s382",
            "start_seconds": 1469.4
          },
          {
            "text": "So be a good role model, set a good example for that young",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1475.6,
            "sentence_id": "s383",
            "start_seconds": 1471.6
          },
          {
            "text": "brother coming up.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1477.533,
            "sentence_id": "s384",
            "start_seconds": 1475.6
          },
          {
            "text": "If you know somebody who's not on point,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1479.0659999999998,
            "sentence_id": "s385",
            "start_seconds": 1477.533
          },
          {
            "text": "go back and bring that brother along -- those who've been left",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1483.066,
            "sentence_id": "s386",
            "start_seconds": 1479.066
          },
          {
            "text": "behind, who haven't had the same opportunities we have --",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1485.767,
            "sentence_id": "s387",
            "start_seconds": 1483.066
          },
          {
            "text": "they need to hear from you.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1488.367,
            "sentence_id": "s388",
            "start_seconds": 1485.767
          },
          {
            "text": "You've got to be engaged on the barbershops,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1492.667,
            "sentence_id": "s389",
            "start_seconds": 1488.367
          },
          {
            "text": "on the basketball court, at church,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1496.433,
            "sentence_id": "s390",
            "start_seconds": 1492.667
          },
          {
            "text": "spend time and energy and presence to give people",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1500.433,
            "sentence_id": "s391",
            "start_seconds": 1496.433
          },
          {
            "text": "opportunities and a chance.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1501.767,
            "sentence_id": "s392",
            "start_seconds": 1500.433
          },
          {
            "text": "Pull them up, expose them, support their dreams.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1505.133,
            "sentence_id": "s393",
            "start_seconds": 1501.767
          },
          {
            "text": "Don't put them down.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1507.9,
            "sentence_id": "s394",
            "start_seconds": 1505.133
          },
          {
            "text": "We've got to teach them just like what we have to learn,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1511.767,
            "sentence_id": "s395",
            "start_seconds": 1507.9
          },
          {
            "text": "what it means to be a man -- to serve your city like",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1514.9,
            "sentence_id": "s396",
            "start_seconds": 1511.767
          },
          {
            "text": "Maynard Jackson; to shape the culture like Spike Lee;",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1519.3670000000002,
            "sentence_id": "s397",
            "start_seconds": 1514.9
          },
          {
            "text": "to be like Chester Davenport, one of the first people to",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1522.633,
            "sentence_id": "s398",
            "start_seconds": 1519.367
          },
          {
            "text": "integrate the University of Georgia Law School.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1525.133,
            "sentence_id": "s399",
            "start_seconds": 1522.633
          },
          {
            "text": "When he got there, nobody would sit next to him in class.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1528.4,
            "sentence_id": "s400",
            "start_seconds": 1525.133
          },
          {
            "text": "But Chester didn't mind.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1530.633,
            "sentence_id": "s401",
            "start_seconds": 1528.4
          },
          {
            "text": "Later on, he said, \"It was the thing for me to do.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1533.1000000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s402",
            "start_seconds": 1530.633
          },
          {
            "text": "Someone needed to be the first.\"",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1535.667,
            "sentence_id": "s403",
            "start_seconds": 1533.1
          },
          {
            "text": "And today, Chester is here celebrating his 50th reunion.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1539.6999999999998,
            "sentence_id": "s404",
            "start_seconds": 1535.667
          },
          {
            "text": "Where is Chester Davenport?",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1544.5,
            "sentence_id": "s405",
            "start_seconds": 1539.7
          },
          {
            "text": "He's here.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1545.467,
            "sentence_id": "s406",
            "start_seconds": 1544.5
          },
          {
            "text": "So if you've had role models, fathers,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1552.7340000000002,
            "sentence_id": "s407",
            "start_seconds": 1550.266
          },
          {
            "text": "brothers like that -- thank them today.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1555.233,
            "sentence_id": "s408",
            "start_seconds": 1552.734
          },
          {
            "text": "And if you haven't, commit yourself to being that man",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1557.734,
            "sentence_id": "s409",
            "start_seconds": 1555.233
          },
          {
            "text": "to somebody else.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1560.166,
            "sentence_id": "s410",
            "start_seconds": 1557.734
          },
          {
            "text": "And finally, as you do these things,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1562.667,
            "sentence_id": "s411",
            "start_seconds": 1560.166
          },
          {
            "text": "do them not just for yourself, but don't even do them just for",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1566.033,
            "sentence_id": "s412",
            "start_seconds": 1562.667
          },
          {
            "text": "the African American community.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1568.433,
            "sentence_id": "s413",
            "start_seconds": 1566.033
          },
          {
            "text": "I want you to set your sights higher.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1570.2,
            "sentence_id": "s414",
            "start_seconds": 1568.433
          },
          {
            "text": "At the turn of the last century, W.E.B.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1573.333,
            "sentence_id": "s415",
            "start_seconds": 1570.2
          },
          {
            "text": "DuBois spoke about the \"talented tenth\" -- a class of highly",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1579.433,
            "sentence_id": "s416",
            "start_seconds": 1573.333
          },
          {
            "text": "educated, socially conscious leaders in the black community.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1584.133,
            "sentence_id": "s417",
            "start_seconds": 1579.433
          },
          {
            "text": "But it's not just the African American community",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1586.066,
            "sentence_id": "s418",
            "start_seconds": 1584.133
          },
          {
            "text": "that needs you.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1587.567,
            "sentence_id": "s419",
            "start_seconds": 1586.066
          },
          {
            "text": "The country needs you.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1589.834,
            "sentence_id": "s420",
            "start_seconds": 1587.567
          },
          {
            "text": "The world needs you.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1591.834,
            "sentence_id": "s421",
            "start_seconds": 1589.834
          },
          {
            "text": "As Morehouse Men, many of you know what it's like to be an",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1595.967,
            "sentence_id": "s422",
            "start_seconds": 1593.2
          },
          {
            "text": "outsider; know what it's like to be marginalized;",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1598.8670000000002,
            "sentence_id": "s423",
            "start_seconds": 1595.967
          },
          {
            "text": "know what it's like to feel the sting of discrimination.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1603.8,
            "sentence_id": "s424",
            "start_seconds": 1598.867
          },
          {
            "text": "And that's an experience that a lot of Americans share.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1608.867,
            "sentence_id": "s425",
            "start_seconds": 1603.8
          },
          {
            "text": "Hispanic Americans know that feeling when somebody asks",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1611.734,
            "sentence_id": "s426",
            "start_seconds": 1608.867
          },
          {
            "text": "them where they come from or tell them to go back.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1615.7669999999998,
            "sentence_id": "s427",
            "start_seconds": 1611.734
          },
          {
            "text": "Gay and lesbian Americans feel it when a stranger",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1617.633,
            "sentence_id": "s428",
            "start_seconds": 1615.767
          },
          {
            "text": "passes judgment on their parenting skills or the",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1620.3,
            "sentence_id": "s429",
            "start_seconds": 1617.633
          },
          {
            "text": "love that they share.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1622.433,
            "sentence_id": "s430",
            "start_seconds": 1620.3
          },
          {
            "text": "Muslim Americans feel it when they're stared at with suspicion",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1625.266,
            "sentence_id": "s431",
            "start_seconds": 1622.433
          },
          {
            "text": "because of their faith.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1628.133,
            "sentence_id": "s432",
            "start_seconds": 1625.266
          },
          {
            "text": "Any woman who knows the injustice of earning less pay",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1630.567,
            "sentence_id": "s433",
            "start_seconds": 1628.133
          },
          {
            "text": "for doing the same work -- she knows what it's like to be on",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1633.667,
            "sentence_id": "s434",
            "start_seconds": 1630.567
          },
          {
            "text": "the outside looking in.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1634.7669999999998,
            "sentence_id": "s435",
            "start_seconds": 1633.667
          },
          {
            "text": "So your experiences give you special insight that",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1641.934,
            "sentence_id": "s436",
            "start_seconds": 1634.767
          },
          {
            "text": "today's leaders need.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1644.367,
            "sentence_id": "s437",
            "start_seconds": 1641.934
          },
          {
            "text": "If you tap into that experience, it should endow you with empathy",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1650.767,
            "sentence_id": "s438",
            "start_seconds": 1644.367
          },
          {
            "text": "-- the understanding of what it's like to walk in somebody",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1652.7,
            "sentence_id": "s439",
            "start_seconds": 1650.767
          },
          {
            "text": "else's shoes, to see through their eyes,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1657.3,
            "sentence_id": "s440",
            "start_seconds": 1652.7
          },
          {
            "text": "to know what it's like when you're not born on 3rd base,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1660.834,
            "sentence_id": "s441",
            "start_seconds": 1657.3
          },
          {
            "text": "thinking you hit a triple.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1663.6670000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s442",
            "start_seconds": 1660.834
          },
          {
            "text": "It should give you the ability to connect.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1667.033,
            "sentence_id": "s443",
            "start_seconds": 1663.667
          },
          {
            "text": "It should give you a sense of compassion and what it",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1669.5,
            "sentence_id": "s444",
            "start_seconds": 1667.033
          },
          {
            "text": "means to overcome barriers.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1670.7,
            "sentence_id": "s445",
            "start_seconds": 1669.5
          },
          {
            "text": "And I will tell you, Class of 2013,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1674.567,
            "sentence_id": "s446",
            "start_seconds": 1670.7
          },
          {
            "text": "whatever success I have achieved,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1676.667,
            "sentence_id": "s447",
            "start_seconds": 1674.567
          },
          {
            "text": "whatever positions of leadership I have held have depended less",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1679.867,
            "sentence_id": "s448",
            "start_seconds": 1676.667
          },
          {
            "text": "on Ivy League degrees or SAT scores or GPAs,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1684.3,
            "sentence_id": "s449",
            "start_seconds": 1679.867
          },
          {
            "text": "and have instead been due to that sense of connection and",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1687.8999999999999,
            "sentence_id": "s450",
            "start_seconds": 1684.3
          },
          {
            "text": "empathy -- the special obligation I felt,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1690.9340000000002,
            "sentence_id": "s451",
            "start_seconds": 1687.9
          },
          {
            "text": "as a black man like you, to help those who need it most,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1694.8999999999999,
            "sentence_id": "s452",
            "start_seconds": 1690.934
          },
          {
            "text": "people who didn't have the opportunities that I had --",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1697.3670000000002,
            "sentence_id": "s453",
            "start_seconds": 1694.9
          },
          {
            "text": "because there but for the grace of God,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1700.0,
            "sentence_id": "s454",
            "start_seconds": 1697.367
          },
          {
            "text": "go I -- I might have been in their shoes.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1702.166,
            "sentence_id": "s455",
            "start_seconds": 1700.0
          },
          {
            "text": "I might have been in prison.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1703.934,
            "sentence_id": "s456",
            "start_seconds": 1702.166
          },
          {
            "text": "I might have been unemployed.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1705.7,
            "sentence_id": "s457",
            "start_seconds": 1703.934
          },
          {
            "text": "I might not have been able to support a family.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1708.0330000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s458",
            "start_seconds": 1705.7
          },
          {
            "text": "And that motivates me.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1711.1,
            "sentence_id": "s459",
            "start_seconds": 1708.033
          },
          {
            "text": "So it's up to you to widen your circle of concern -- to care",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1717.533,
            "sentence_id": "s460",
            "start_seconds": 1712.867
          },
          {
            "text": "about justice for everybody, white, black and brown.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1723.6329999999998,
            "sentence_id": "s461",
            "start_seconds": 1717.533
          },
          {
            "text": "Everybody.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1724.2,
            "sentence_id": "s462",
            "start_seconds": 1723.633
          },
          {
            "text": "Not just in your own community, but also across this country",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1726.467,
            "sentence_id": "s463",
            "start_seconds": 1724.2
          },
          {
            "text": "and around the world.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1728.3670000000002,
            "sentence_id": "s464",
            "start_seconds": 1726.467
          },
          {
            "text": "To make sure everyone has a voice,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1730.166,
            "sentence_id": "s465",
            "start_seconds": 1728.367
          },
          {
            "text": "and everybody gets a seat at the table; that everybody,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1733.7,
            "sentence_id": "s466",
            "start_seconds": 1730.166
          },
          {
            "text": "no matter what you look like or where you come from,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1736.834,
            "sentence_id": "s467",
            "start_seconds": 1733.7
          },
          {
            "text": "what your last name is -- it doesn't matter,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1740.467,
            "sentence_id": "s468",
            "start_seconds": 1736.834
          },
          {
            "text": "everybody gets a chance to walk through those doors of",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1743.2,
            "sentence_id": "s469",
            "start_seconds": 1740.467
          },
          {
            "text": "opportunity if they are willing to work hard enough.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1748.367,
            "sentence_id": "s470",
            "start_seconds": 1743.2
          },
          {
            "text": "When Leland Shelton was four years old -- where's Leland?",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1751.3,
            "sentence_id": "s471",
            "start_seconds": 1748.367
          },
          {
            "text": "Stand up, Leland.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1756.033,
            "sentence_id": "s472",
            "start_seconds": 1753.734
          },
          {
            "text": "When Leland Shelton was four years old,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1757.533,
            "sentence_id": "s473",
            "start_seconds": 1756.033
          },
          {
            "text": "social services took him away from his mama,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1761.6329999999998,
            "sentence_id": "s474",
            "start_seconds": 1757.533
          },
          {
            "text": "put him in the care of his grandparents.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1763.367,
            "sentence_id": "s475",
            "start_seconds": 1761.633
          },
          {
            "text": "By age 14, he was in the foster care system.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1769.533,
            "sentence_id": "s476",
            "start_seconds": 1765.433
          },
          {
            "text": "Three years after that, Leland enrolled in Morehouse.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1774.0659999999998,
            "sentence_id": "s477",
            "start_seconds": 1769.533
          },
          {
            "text": "And today he is graduating Phi Beta Kappa on his way",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1777.8,
            "sentence_id": "s478",
            "start_seconds": 1774.066
          },
          {
            "text": "to Harvard Law School.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1779.667,
            "sentence_id": "s479",
            "start_seconds": 1777.8
          },
          {
            "text": "But he's not stopping there.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1790.133,
            "sentence_id": "s480",
            "start_seconds": 1788.567
          },
          {
            "text": "As a member of the National Foster Care Youth and Alumni",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1794.0,
            "sentence_id": "s481",
            "start_seconds": 1790.133
          },
          {
            "text": "Policy Council, he plans to use his law degree to make sure kids",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1798.1,
            "sentence_id": "s482",
            "start_seconds": 1794.0
          },
          {
            "text": "like him don't fall through the cracks.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1800.8,
            "sentence_id": "s483",
            "start_seconds": 1798.1
          },
          {
            "text": "And it won't matter whether they're black kids or brown",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1803.2659999999998,
            "sentence_id": "s484",
            "start_seconds": 1800.8
          },
          {
            "text": "kids or white kids or Native American kids,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1807.3670000000002,
            "sentence_id": "s485",
            "start_seconds": 1803.266
          },
          {
            "text": "because he'll understand what they're going through.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1809.6,
            "sentence_id": "s486",
            "start_seconds": 1807.367
          },
          {
            "text": "And he'll be fighting for them.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1812.734,
            "sentence_id": "s487",
            "start_seconds": 1809.6
          },
          {
            "text": "He'll be in their corner.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1815.7669999999998,
            "sentence_id": "s488",
            "start_seconds": 1812.734
          },
          {
            "text": "That's leadership.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1817.5,
            "sentence_id": "s489",
            "start_seconds": 1815.767
          },
          {
            "text": "That's a Morehouse Man right there.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1819.133,
            "sentence_id": "s490",
            "start_seconds": 1817.5
          },
          {
            "text": "That's what we've come to expect from you,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1822.3000000000002,
            "sentence_id": "s491",
            "start_seconds": 1820.4
          },
          {
            "text": "Morehouse -- a legacy of leaders -- not just in",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1825.3999999999999,
            "sentence_id": "s492",
            "start_seconds": 1822.3
          },
          {
            "text": "our black community, but for the entire American community.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1830.066,
            "sentence_id": "s493",
            "start_seconds": 1825.4
          },
          {
            "text": "To recognize the burdens you carry with you,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1831.9,
            "sentence_id": "s494",
            "start_seconds": 1830.066
          },
          {
            "text": "but to resist the temptation to use them as excuses.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1836.567,
            "sentence_id": "s495",
            "start_seconds": 1831.9
          },
          {
            "text": "To transform the way we think about manhood,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1839.6,
            "sentence_id": "s496",
            "start_seconds": 1836.567
          },
          {
            "text": "and set higher standards for ourselves and for others.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1843.9669999999999,
            "sentence_id": "s497",
            "start_seconds": 1839.6
          },
          {
            "text": "To be successful, but also to understand that each of us has",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1846.7,
            "sentence_id": "s498",
            "start_seconds": 1843.967
          },
          {
            "text": "responsibilities not just to ourselves,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1849.066,
            "sentence_id": "s499",
            "start_seconds": 1846.7
          },
          {
            "text": "but to one another and to future generations.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1851.2,
            "sentence_id": "s500",
            "start_seconds": 1849.066
          },
          {
            "text": "Men who refuse to be afraid.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1856.066,
            "sentence_id": "s501",
            "start_seconds": 1854.066
          },
          {
            "text": "Men who refuse to be afraid.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1860.667,
            "sentence_id": "s502",
            "start_seconds": 1857.934
          },
          {
            "text": "Members of the Class of 2013, you are heirs to a great legacy.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1867.6999999999998,
            "sentence_id": "s503",
            "start_seconds": 1862.667
          },
          {
            "text": "You have within you that same courage and that same strength,",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1871.1000000000001,
            "sentence_id": "s504",
            "start_seconds": 1867.7
          },
          {
            "text": "the same resolve as the men who came before you.",
            "speaker_id": null,
            "end_seconds": 1874.7669999999998,
            "sentence_id": "s505",
            "start_seconds": 1871.1
          },
          {
            "text": "That's what being a Morehouse Man is all about.",
            "speaker_id": null,
